```mermaid
classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ backend class diagram.
    %% Reflects the four backend classes in Objects.py.

    class User {
        +str owner_name
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +int age
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +get_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Task {
        +str description
        +str time
        +int duration
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +mark_complete() None
    }

    class Schedule {
        +User user
        +get_schedule() list~Task~
        +sort_by_time(tasks: list~Task~) list~Task~
        +filter_tasks(status: bool, pet_name: str) list~Task~
        +detect_conflicts() list~str~
    }

    User "1" --> "*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" --> "*" Task : has
    Schedule "1" --> "1" User : organizes tasks for
```
